= \frac{(1\times4)+(2\times0)+(3\times6)+(4\times4)+(5\times2)+(6\times3)+(7\times2)+(8\times1)}{22}
= \frac{4+0+18+16+10+18+14+8}{22}
= \frac{88}{22}
= 4
The mean of the number of nests in each tree is 4.
